  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Doggy Wash Express is a 100% self-service dog washing station in Nice, on avenue Saint-Barthélémy. The postcode varies between directories (06100 or 06000): the number and the avenue are enough to get there. It runs on an automated terminal with card payment, with no staff on site.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The station offers shampoo, conditioner, anti-parasite treatment, and a choice of gentle or strong drying, with products certified by veterinary labs and lukewarm water for the dog's comfort. The station is open 7 days a week: its Instagram account says 8am to 6pm, while 2025 press coverage and directories gave 8am to 8pm. All breeds and sizes are accepted (Instagram), and the manager told France Bleu (March 2025) that large dogs and dogs of restricted categories, sometimes turned away by grooming salons, are welcome. Payment is by bank card only. Prices are shown in the highlighted stories of the Instagram account. Station phone: 06 27 01 75 05.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: a station that opened in early 2025 — check the most recent reviews before going.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Saint-Barthélémy neighbourhood, in the north of Nice, is close to the roads leading into the Nice hinterland.</p>
